                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I had an enjoyable time with this, including the bonus prequel chapter. I really enjoyed the variety of minigames/puzzles, and the story/character work was remarkably effective for a HOG. The hidden object puzzles themselves they tried a number of different approaches to and sometimes I found them a bit fussy, like having to figure out what parts of the scenery needed to be pushed aside to find the object on the list. All told, this felt like a \"premium\" experience for this genre; I'm actually looking forward to checking out their big genre pivot Scars Above since I see that's on sale at time of review.\r\n",
